;; Genes that metformin interacts with AND that are associated with type 2 diabetes.
;; Metformin: 120 KG2 ids from expand_entity(CHEBI:6801) -> membership relation met_set.
;; T2D: 9 KG2 ids from expand_entity(MONDO:0005148), inlined as literals.
;; Interaction: interacts_with / physically_interacts_with /
;;   directly_physically_interacts_with, in both edge directions.
;; Association: biolink:gene_associated_with_condition.
;; The interacting gene g and the T2D-associated gene t are joined on their
;; canonical CURIE k via kg2_norm (different source vocabularies per side).
;; Two stages: met_set, then result.

table (edge str str str)
table (node str str str)
table (kg2_norm str str)
table (met_set str)
table (result str str str)

